      <gmd:abstract>
        <gco:CharacterString>Natural Resources Wales (NRW) Discovery Metadata Catalogue Service. This Catalogue Service for the Web (CSW) includes endpoints for records within the NRW's Discovery metadata catalogue for external use. The metadata provides details of datasets held by NRW.  Natural Resources Wales is the largest Welsh Government Sponsored Body. NRW's purpose is to ensure the environment and natural resources of Wales are sustainably maintained and used, now and in the future.</gco:CharacterString>
      </gmd:abstract>
